  "title": "Paldiski: Cliff, Lighthouse and Blue Berries",
  "date": "2026-08-15T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Paldiski: Cliff, Lighthouse and Blue Berries\n\nPaldiski\n\nToday, we hiked Paldiski, a harbour under Tallinn. This time I can see some formal cliffs.\n\nI have to take the elron train to go outside Tallinn. Turns out the trip outside Tallinn can not paid by the Tallinn bus card. Still a bank card is needed. I just have discount.\n\nbeach\n\nbeach\n\nAnout 90 minutes hiking along the cliff. We saw the lighthouse. 5 EUR to go up.\n\nLighthouse\n\nThis harbour has deep water, so here are a lot power plants, not only wind generator, also solar farm and a huge storage looks like gas or petrol.\n\nPowerplant\n\ngrassland\n\nOn the way to the train station, there are blue berries everywhere. I was eating the whole way.\n\nblueberry\n\nIt was raining on the train back. This is the huge rainbow ar Hiiu station.\n\nHiiu",
